Do I think historians are
going to give up documents?

00:57:19.790 --> 00:57:20.940
No (chuckles).

00:57:20.940 --> 00:57:24.360
I mean, part of it is that we
have, as we get closer in time

00:57:24.360 --> 00:57:27.640
to the present, we have so
much more documentary material

00:57:27.640 --> 00:57:30.210
and so much more coverage

00:57:30.210 --> 00:57:34.180
