the experience was like.

00:57:49.260 --> 00:57:51.870
And so, I think it's very important

00:57:51.870 --> 00:57:55.100
as we try to understand the
history of the whole world

00:57:55.100 --> 00:57:57.890
and all the different regions
of the world that we use

00:57:57.890 --> 00:58:01.830
every technology we can
to reconstruct the past

00:58:01.830 --> 00:58:06.340
that's lost to us, but
I think there's still

00:58:07.350 --> 00:58:09.600
pleasures or insights to be,

00:58:09.600 --> 00:58:12.120
pleasures from studying,
insights to be derived

00:58:12.120 --> 00:58:14.120
