01:09:32.340 --> 01:09:34.640
It was...

01:09:34.640 --> 01:09:35.473
- Right.

01:09:35.473 --> 01:09:36.306
No no.

01:09:36.306 --> 01:09:37.470
I was wondering if you
could talk a little bit

01:09:37.470 --> 01:09:39.380
