01:13:59.470 --> 01:14:01.840
So too many for an alphabet,

01:14:01.840 --> 01:14:04.270
but too few for pictorial script.

01:14:04.270 --> 01:14:05.997
- Right.
(Valerie laughs)

01:14:05.997 --> 01:14:08.483
- Right, so that's very interesting.

01:14:09.820 --> 01:14:11.313
You know, is it...

01:14:14.080 --> 01:14:17.000
I hate to say, we're never
going to decipher it.

01:14:17.000 --> 01:14:18.410
- Right.
- You know, that may be one

01:14:18.410 --> 01:14:21.976
of those problems that
somebody figures out

01:14:21.976 --> 01:14:25.423
and you know, I mean I was
gonna say the Maya script

01:14:25.423 --> 01:14:28.890
defied (mumbling) for so long.

01:14:28.890 --> 01:14:32.510
And then, you know, this kind of basic,

01:14:32.510 --> 01:14:34.900
I mean I think there was a coincidence

01:14:34.900 --> 01:14:39.070
