01:15:09.690 --> 01:15:11.990
So anyway, that's why you know,

01:15:11.990 --> 01:15:16.800
I had the Harappan script in
a different category whether--

01:15:16.800 --> 01:15:19.250
- What I found really
fascinating to imagine

01:15:19.250 --> 01:15:21.050
from reading your book and listening

01:15:21.050 --> 01:15:24.550
to you today was, you
know, the imagination

01:15:24.550 --> 01:15:27.400
of what these encounters,
when these people showed up,

01:15:27.400 --> 01:15:30.197
