01:16:02.400 --> 01:16:06.540
and a local, an indigenous woman.

01:16:06.540 --> 01:16:09.160
And the Norse woman says,
you know, my name is

01:16:09.160 --> 01:16:10.150
I think it's Gertrude.

01:16:10.150 --> 01:16:12.780
And that a local woman says,
oh, my name is Gertrude.

01:16:12.780 --> 01:16:13.950
And you think that it makes no sense

01:16:13.950 --> 01:16:16.748
and it does 'cause she's just
repeating what she hears.

01:16:16.748 --> 01:16:17.660
Right?
- Wow.

01:16:17.660 --> 01:16:19.850
- So that that would be the logical thing.

01:16:19.850 --> 01:16:21.200
You've just, when you're start to work

01:16:21.200 --> 01:16:24.220
on somebody's language, they
say something, you say it back

01:16:24.220 --> 01:16:27.183
and then you start building
up these sentences.

01:16:27.183 --> 01:16:31.730
- Evidence that women
were on these voyages too?

01:16:31.730 --> 01:16:32.667
- Yes, there is.

01:16:32.667 --> 01:16:34.580
And there's archaeological evidence

01:16:34.580 --> 01:16:37.930
for both the Polynesians and the Vikings.

01:16:37.930 --> 01:16:41.950
The Viking evidence is we
have the a needle sharpener

01:16:41.950 --> 01:16:44.753
and also a weight that was used for,

01:16:47.660 --> 01:16:50.320
to hold the yarn down
when you were spinning it.

01:16:50.320 --> 01:16:52.460
And we also, in the sagas,
they talk about women.

01:16:52.460 --> 01:16:56.860
There's a woman who is quite feisty,

01:16:56.860 --> 01:16:58.930
and she bears she gets into
a fight with the local people

01:16:58.930 --> 01:17:02.270
and she bears her breast and
slaps it with her, a dagger.

01:17:02.270 --> 01:17:04.350
And they all run away the source tells us,

01:17:04.350 --> 01:17:08.550
appalled by her behavior or
terrified by her behavior.

01:17:08.550 --> 01:17:10.810
So, and then for the Polynesians,
we know women are there

01:17:10.810 --> 01:17:14.030
because the Polynesians multiply.

01:17:14.030 --> 01:17:15.480
That you know, if it had been all men,

01:17:15.480 --> 01:17:16.930
they would have landed on the islands

01:17:16.930 --> 01:17:18.760
and died after a certain amount of time,

01:17:18.760 --> 01:17:21.850
but they have children and
the population gets going.

01:17:21.850 --> 01:17:25.390
So we know that women are
on those voyages, too.

01:17:25.390 --> 01:17:26.223
- Wow.

01:17:30.546 --> 01:17:34.301
I think there's another
suggestion for another book.

01:17:34.301 --> 01:17:36.530
(laughing)

01:17:36.530 --> 01:17:39.850
- [Man] Is chocolate and Chaco
Canyon just a coincidence?

01:17:39.850 --> 01:17:41.230
(laughing)
- No, no it's not.

01:17:41.230 --> 01:17:44.900
That's trade between,
there's sustained trade

01:17:44.900 --> 01:17:48.000
between Chaco Canyon and the Maya.

01:17:48.000 --> 01:17:51.280
We've got the chocolate
going from the Maya north.

01:17:51.280 --> 01:17:52.740
We also have I didn't mention this

01:17:52.740 --> 01:17:55.130
'cause of time macaw feathers.

01:17:55.130 --> 01:17:59.342
So we have these brightly
colored green and red feathers

01:17:59.342 --> 01:18:02.442
and we've got feather tapestries that

01:18:02.442 --> 01:18:05.330
have been found that
have these macaw feathers

01:18:05.330 --> 01:18:07.346
in them that date to around the year 1000.

01:18:07.346 --> 01:18:09.412
We also have sadly birdcages

01:18:09.412 --> 01:18:13.290
in which there are dead macaw skeletons

01:18:13.290 --> 01:18:18.150
and the skeletons were malnourished.

01:18:18.150 --> 01:18:19.190
And they had as if they had been

01:18:19.190 --> 01:18:21.910
kept inside and not fed enough.

01:18:21.910 --> 01:18:24.426
So there's definitely a two way trade

01:18:24.426 --> 01:18:28.903
between Chaco Canyon and Chichen Itza.

01:18:30.420 --> 01:18:31.520
- Any other questions?

01:18:35.090 --> 01:18:39.100
If not, let's thank
Valerie for a fantastic,

01:18:39.100 --> 01:18:40.840
thought provoking talk.

01:18:40.840 --> 01:18:43.840
And I'll just, I think we
should unmute everybody

01:18:43.840 --> 01:18:47.723
so that we can give her
a round of applause.

01:18:47.723 --> 01:18:48.717
(clapping)

